            },
            "description": "Requires api.enable_raw_sql=true. When disabled this route 404s (confirmed 404 on pgfoundation.dev.tripleq.ai) and does not appear in /v1/openapi.json. Note: a double-quoted Postgres identifier inside the sql string must have its quotes escaped as \\\" in JSON, or the body itself becomes invalid JSON."
          }
